# Prism Toolshop conventions

- Keep Prism folders: `UI/pageobjects`, `API/pageobjects`, `API/utilities`, `tests/UI Test`, `tests/API Test`.
- Route UI work through `POManager`. Do not put locators in spec files unless a one-off wait is required.
- Tag tests `@smoke` or `@regression`. Keep 5–8 automated cases per tier.
- UI checkout invoice generation requires **two Confirm clicks**.
- Never commit personal secrets. Demo Toolshop accounts are public fixture data only.
- Prefer `data-test` locators. Validate AI output against the live SUT before keeping it.
